    "body": "R02A implementation plan only; no implementation code.\n\nApproved spec authority:\n- PR #123\n- exact spec HEAD `2bdf508e1f265bcf3ce56170cfa4ab08f04c2ec8`\n- OWNER command: `УТВЕРЖДАЮ R02A SPEC PR #123 HEAD 2bdf508e1f265bcf3ce56170cfa4ab08f04c2ec8 FOR IMPLEMENTATION PLANNING`\n\nPlan contents:\n- primary seven-task TDD implementation plan\n- Amendment 01 from self-review: public `AUTH_ENV_KEYS` interface, exact Go Task 3.53.1 download+SHA256 installation, explicit implementation-branch choreography, exact Copilot package provenance\n- hosted LESTER/DUNCAN topology\n- process-only Copilot token boundary\n- revisioned R01/R02A admission authority\n- pre-existing proof fixture for the approved no-create Copilot tool surface\n- full E2E/security/regression gates\n\nNo implementation, merge, production activation, runner registration, canon mutation, OWNER LOCK mutation, issue #102 reopen, or PR #103 mutation is authorized by this PR.\n\nNEXT HARD GATE: OWNER approval of this exact composite plan HEAD for TDD implementation.",
